# Tone and hammer swept end to end, pan and level too, then a legato octave and a bend (pitch without onNoteOn).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1
track chord
sample ../opzk_piano.aif samplepacks/opzk_piano.aif
preset 128 128 0 255 255 20 0 0 128 0 128 215 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C4 2 100
note 0 G4 2 100
note 2 C4 2 100
note 2 G4 2 100
note 4 C4 2 100
note 4 G4 2 100
note 6 C4 2 100
note 6 G4 2 100
note 8 C4 2 100
note 8 G4 2 100
note 10 C4 2 100
note 10 G4 2 100
note 12 C4 2 100
note 12 G4 2 100
note 14 C4 2 100
note 14 G4 2 100
sweep p1 0 255 0 8
sweep p2 0 255 8 16
sweep pan 0 255 16 24
sweep level 255 0 24 30
note 16 C4 14 100
param note_style 255 18
note 18 C5 4 100
bend 20 200
bend 22 -200
expect sound 0 24
expect peak_below 0
